Subject: [PATCH 224/224] Meridian: split drop preview, grain by default,
 Changes beside Files

Held over a tab, a tab shows the empty half it will take, left or right.
The grain is on unless a space turned it off. Workbench's git shows other
repositories an agent worked in, for viewing, and a branch against its base.
